| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Recursive** | $O(n)$ | $O(n)$ | Elegant, but risks Stack Overflow on huge $n$. |
| **Iterative** | $O(n)$ | $O(1)$ | More memory efficient. |
| **BigInt** | $O(n)$ | $O(1)$ | Essential for $n > 21$ to maintain integer precision. |

