| **Recursion** | Very clean, follows the mathematical definition | Risk of stack overflow for large `n` |
| **Optimized with `bigint`** | Best for large numbers, prevents overflow, type-safe | Slightly more complex logic |
| **`reduce`** | Very functional and concise | Can be less intuitive for beginners |

